## Title: GCD Weave Timer
## Description: GCD Weave Timer helps players practise and improve Light Attack weaving by showing a centre-collapse Global Cooldown bar, a clear weave zone, optional WEAVE NOW prompt, Light Attack feedback, valid-weave streak tracking, dungeon/trial Lite Mode, and abilityId-first channel-aware timing for beam/channel skills such as Fatecarver, Radiant, Soul Assault, Flurry morphs, and DK breath channels. Customisation includes a master on/off toggle, dungeon/trial Lite Mode, preview mode, centre-anchored X/Y slider positioning, weave window timing, post-window grace, channel hold, and LA streak display settings.
